senses.gloss:
ग्रथन, अम्, n. coagulation, thickening, be-
coming obstructed or clogged with knotty lumps;
(आ), f. tying, binding, stringing together.

ग्रथित, अस्, आ, अम्, strung, tied, bound, con-
nected, tied together or in order, wound, arranged,
classed, collected; set with, strewn with; artificially
composed or put together (as the plot of a play);
difficult to be unravelled, having knots, knotty, formed
into lumps, coagulated, thickened, clogged; hardened;
hurt, injured; seized, taken possession of; overcome;
(अम्), n. a tumor with hard lumps or knots.

ग्रामक, अस्, m. a village &c., see ग्राम; the
collective department or range of celestial pleasures;
N. of a town.
